      "Language": "pol",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Postoperative course in 12 patients which had laparoscopic adrenalectomy performed was compared with 8 underwent classic one in terms of operating time, blood loss, blood pressure recordings, C-reactive protein blood concentration, postoperative pain and hospital stay. The advantages of the laparoscopic approach have been stressed."},
